    {
      "id": 14130,
      "hub_id": null,
      "version": "4.7.0",
      "description": "<p>Added an option to backport the Kordbreach / EFT 1.1.0.0 Collector prerequisites based on <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://x.com/tarkov/status/2077755562490581359\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">@tarkov’s recent tweet</a>.</p>\n<p>Added a new setting <code>questOverrides</code> that allows overriding the settings from <code>removeConditions</code> for individual quests.</p>\n<p>Repeating the example in the description, Forester’s Duty could be expanded from villages to the entire maps to match live by adding <code>{\"66ab9da7eb102b9bcd08591c\": {\"zone\": true}}</code> while leaving the zones for other quests like Capturing Outposts and Secured Perimeter in effect.</p>\n<p>When using the <code>onlyQuests</code> and <code>exemptQuests</code> settings, overrides will <em>always</em> take effect but will only fall back to the global/default settings in <code>removeConditions</code> depending on the quest’s presence in those settings.</p>\n",
